---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Contact Us" description="Contact LaunchLegit about your U.S. TikTok Shop launch.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container reveal"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Contact Us</div><span class="section-kicker">Contact</span><h1>Let's talk about your U.S. TikTok Shop launch.</h1><p class="lead">The best way to get started is a direct call. We’ll learn where you are today and talk through the next steps for your brand or creator business.</p></div></section>
  <section><div class="container split">
    <div class="card reveal"><span class="section-kicker">Start a conversation</span><h2>Book a call with LaunchLegit</h2><p class="muted">We’re currently booking conversations directly. Use the call link below or email us and we’ll coordinate a time.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#calendly-section">Book a call</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="mailto:hello@launchlegit.com">Email us</a></div></div>
    <div class="panel reveal"><span class="section-kicker">What to bring</span><ul class="check-list"><li><b>✓</b> Your current business or entity setup</li><li><b>✓</b> Your country and target U.S. market</li><li><b>✓</b> Whether you’re a creator or a brand</li><li><b>✓</b> Any TikTok Shop setup or verification issue</li></ul></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="eu-close"><div class="container split"><div class="reveal"><span class="section-kicker">EU & UK sellers</span><h2>European-friendly coordination from first call to launch.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><p class="lead">We understand that an EU/UK expansion can sit alongside existing VAT, tax, privacy and company obligations. We use GDPR-conscious language, keep documentation clear and can coordinate meetings around European business hours.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:hello@launchlegit.com">Email LaunchLegit</a></div></div></section>
</Layout>
